,"name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Sad6etx6kKYxrpvWcd11MA","review_id":"sC8pxjgOlo5kbrW5wL35FA","date":"2016-04-09T22:57:49","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9375130534172058,"text_excerpt":"We stopped by here during the French Quarter Fest for a martini and blood mary. They were both delish. The bartenders were prompt and very helpful. This place has a good vibe with a small bar and some tables (around 8 or 10). We then ordered a hamburger (the original). It came out promptly and was perfect. It had buttered buns with pickles, lettuce, tomatoes and red onions and comes with \"really good\" garlic fries. Never had them before but I recommend them to anyone. So if you out and about in the French Quarter and want a sure bet and a good drink I recommend this place."},{"business_id":"Sad6etx6kKYxrpvWcd11MA","review_id":"fYepEd_wUDQ6M_EksrSZAA","date":"2020-03-18T11:28:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9353736639022827,"text_excerpt":"My friends and I found New Orleans Hamburger & Seafood on Yelp while walking around the area and decided to stop in for a bite to eat. We were seated right away in the upstairs area where they also have a balcony. We sat inside, which was a good idea as I think one of the groups on the balcony was forgotten about (I saw someone come in and say they'd been waiting for 40 minutes without anyone coming over). The menu includes what you might expect... hamburgers and seafood along with some other New Orleans specialties and some salads. My boyfriend and I ordered a half dozen raw oysters and the catfish poboy to share. You can choose either thin or thick catfish for the poboy (you can also ge..."},{"business_id":"Sad6etx6kKYxrpvWcd11MA","review_id":"BsjrXCCechKXLFbGjk0N3A","date":"2019-07-13T13:53:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9322072267532349,"text_excerpt":"We had an hour to grab something to eat before my sweetheart was arriving on the choo choo from New England so of course the obvious choice was to head for the French Quarter and came across this place. I love the open air restaurants in this town and this one fits the bill. This place has been around since 1984 and is at the beginning of the French quarter close to the Riverside, river walk and the end of Canal Street and conveniently located across from great parking. (I park here quite a bit but the process are rediculous now @ $10 for 1st hr & $33 for the 2nd, rediculous) They have eight locations in and around Nawlins. I ate upstairs here a few years ago and don't remember the meal b..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Sad6etx6kKYxrpvWcd11MA","photo_id":"hqjE22vWEhBT9HxKTPF1yA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/hqjE22vWEhBT9HxKTPF1yA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9077066779136658},{"business_id":"Sad6etx6kKYxrpvWcd11MA","photo_id":"d_OXQP2jNbaaKoxOksqbiA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/d_OXQP2jNbaaKoxOksqbiA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8762109279632568},{"business_id":"Sad6etx6kKYxrpvWcd11MA","photo_id":"6M_EmL51mT3uFLx7dQBqnA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/6M_EmL51mT3uFLx7dQBqnA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8121119737625122},{"business_id":"Sad6etx6kKYxrpvWcd11MA","photo_id":"b1bEVyKpIxh3Inc688CB1g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/b1bEVyKpIxh3Inc688CB1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7975144982337952},{"business_id":